# dist-relative paths that scripts/build-vercel-output.mjs leaves out of the
# uploaded Build Output. This is our own file — Vercel's vercel.json schema
# rejects unknown keys, so the list cannot live there.
#
# The three contract trees below are the disposable-localnet proving keys
# (~64 MB). They are only ever fetched in `?demoMode=local`, which drives a
# devnet on http://localhost:8088 and http://localhost:9944 — endpoints no
# visitor to a public deployment can reach. Shipping them would be 64 MB that
# cannot be used. `/zk/passport-c1` and `/zk/midnames` ARE shipped: those are
# the classic-mode and .night-registration circuits the preview network uses.

zk/account
zk/faucet
zk/identity_registry

# Self-ignoring marker written into public/zk-params by fetch-zk-params.mjs.
zk-params/.gitignore
